  }
}
TIMEZONE & ROUTING RULES:
- All relative voice prompts spoken by user (e.g. 'tomorrow at 5pm') MUST be evaluated in the User's Local Timezone (America/Chicago).
- Always include local timezone offset in date_time (e.g. '-05:00').
- If a task/reminder request specifies an exact time of day (e.g. 'at 5pm', 'at 3:30', 'at 9am'), set intent to 'CALENDAR' so a timed event notification is scheduled.
